***REMOVED*** .dockerignore — tells Docker what NOT to copy into the image.
***REMOVED*** Rule of thumb: if it's not needed to RUN inference, exclude it.
***REMOVED*** This keeps the image lean and build times fast.

***REMOVED*** ── Large data files (NDA / sensitive) ──────────────────────────────────────
data/
*.parquet
*.csv
*.xlsx

***REMOVED*** ── Experiment outputs and training runs ─────────────────────────────────────
experiments/
lightning_logs/
outputs/
logs/
reports/

***REMOVED*** ── Thesis / evaluation artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
freeze/final_thesis_v1/eval*/
freeze/final_thesis_v1/benchmarks/
freeze/final_thesis_v1/tft_ablation/
freeze/final_thesis_v1/plots/
freeze/_old*/
freeze/_safety*/

***REMOVED*** ── Checkpoints we DON'T need in Docker ──────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** (v1 RL kept for reference, v2 is the production model)
freeze/final_thesis_v1/rl/ddqn_minenv_v1/
backups/

***REMOVED*** ── Development / testing / docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────
tests/
docs/
*.md
*.rst
*.tex
*.png
*.pdf
*.pptx

***REMOVED*** ── Python cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

***REMOVED*** ── Environment files (we install deps fresh inside the container) ────────────
envs/
.venv/
venv/
*.conda

***REMOVED*** ── Secrets and local config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.ecmwf_credentials.json
.DS_Store

***REMOVED*** ── Git history (not needed at runtime) ──────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
